    "rendered": "<p>The Koala 50 is the ideal mobile refrigerated container for the safe transport of temperature-controlled products. Robust construction: Made with CFC- and HCFC-free materials, ensuring excellent thermal performance, preserving the organoleptic properties of transported goods, and reducing the risk of bacterial growth. Optimal capacity: 53 liters, ideal for transporting laboratory samples or other temperature-sensitive items. [&hellip;]</p>\n",
